 "hook": "ShinyConf is more than just an event; it's a global gathering of diverse Shiny community, creating a shared space for learning, networking, and collaborative exploration. Connect with like-minded enthusiasts from all corners of the world! Your TidyTuesday maintainers -- Tracy Teal and Jon Harmon -- are both speaking at ShinyConf on Thursday, 2024-04-18. We look forward to seeing you there! What is the most popular way in which packages are connected to Shiny? Can you create a Shiny app to explore this data?",
